\n**Ordering too much or too little.**\n- Average demand is about 4.6% above the forecast. Candidate 7 orders exactly the forecast, so its stock steadily runs down and it pays shortage penalties.\n- Orders at 1.26–1.3× the forecast (candidates 0 and 3) pile up stock until it spoils. That costs roughly 9 per wasted unit of item 0 and 12 per wasted unit of item 1, plus storage.\n- The best scale looks like about 1.1–1.15×. Candidates 6, 2 and 4 are there, and candidate 5 is close.\n\n**Ranking.** Candidate 6 is the most likely to be in the top half: right scale and the best ordering frequency. Candidate 2 is next, then 4 and 5. Candidate 1 is a borderline case close to candidate 2. Candidates 0, 3 and 7 are the least likely."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4395, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4395}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:07:16.587Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVPtkZJTcan5BheNpUHN"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_011onDHPYMkEygYHPMCFynZA", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVPtkmDG3u9xH5TSjHqk", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_011onDHPYMkEygYHPMCFynZA", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.3, 0.42, 0.65, 0.2, 0.65, 0.6, 0.75, 0.3]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], 